<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Daily Tiffin</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="landing-page">
  <%- include('partials/nav', { context: 'landing' }) %>
  <main class="landing-main">
    <section class="landing-hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">The calm behind the lunch rush</p>
        <h1>Run your tiffin service by the day, not by the guesswork.</h1>
        <p class="intro">One simple workspace for weekday meal subscriptions, pauses, customer status, and fair month-end bills.</p>
        <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/register">Start managing</a><a class="text-link" href="/login">Owner login</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note" aria-label="Daily Tiffin summary"><span class="note-mark">01</span><p>Plan the meals.<br><strong>We count the days.</strong></p><small>Built for tiffin and lunch delivery owners.</small></div>
    </section>

    <section id="features" class="landing-section feature-section">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">At a glance</p><h2>The essentials, in one place.</h2></div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article><span class="feature-number">01</span><h3>Subscriptions that flex</h3><p>Start a customer on a plan, pause deliveries when needed, and resume without losing the record.</p></article>
        <article><span class="feature-number">02</span><h3>Billing that feels fair</h3><p>Month-end totals are prorated from weekdays actually available for delivery, including mid-month starts.</p></article>
        <article><span class="feature-number">03</span><h3>A live owner view</h3><p>Find customers by name or phone and see active, paused, cancelled, and unstarted accounts at a glance.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-section help-section">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Made for the people doing the work</p><h2>Less spreadsheet stitching. More lunch delivered.</h2></div>
      <p>Daily Tiffin gives small tiffin and lunch delivery teams one dependable place to manage recurring customers, handle exceptions, and explain every bill. Your team gets a clearer morning run and customers get charges they can understand.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="coming-next" class="landing-section next-section">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">On the horizon</p><h2>Coming next</h2></div>
      <div class="next-list"><div><span>01</span><p>Customer self-service ordering - browse the day's menu and place/skip orders themselves</p></div><div><span>02</span><p>Owner-editable daily menu with delivery time slots per route</p></div><div><span>03</span><p>Integrated online payments (UPI/card) for monthly plan renewal</p></div></div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="landing-footer"><span>Daily Tiffin</span><span>Weekday meals, made manageable.</span></footer>
  <script src="/app.js"></script>
  <script src="/owner.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
